---
description: Kili Jothidam project rules
alwaysApply: true
---
- Stack: Next.js App Router, TypeScript strict, Tailwind, Firebase, Vitest, Playwright.
- Every feature needs tests. Do not finish a task until `pnpm lint && pnpm typecheck && pnpm test` pass.
- No `any`. Validate all external input with zod.
- All user-facing text lives in i18n files (messages/en.json, messages/ta.json). No hard-coded strings in components.
- Daily pick, streak, and collection logic run ONLY on the server (route handlers + Firebase Admin). The client never decides a result.
- Day boundaries use the Asia/Kolkata timezone (IST).
- Never expose secrets to the client. Only NEXT_PUBLIC_* values may be public.
- Never log tokens, emails, or personal data.
- Keep functions small and pure where possible. Put business logic in /src/lib, not in components.
- Accessibility: keyboard usable, alt text, sufficient contrast, respects prefers-reduced-motion.
- Prefer small, reviewable changes. Explain what you changed.
